   "kind": "text",
   "role": "assistant",
   "conversation": "conv-1",
   "evidence": "wire",
   "value": {
    "text": "**Forecast for Barcelona:** Day 1 will be rainy with a high of 21°C. Day 2 will be sunny with a high of 22°C.\n\n**Packing list:**\n\nPack light, layerable clothing for mild temperatures of 21–22°C. Bring two or three t-shirts or breathable tops, a light sweater or cardigan for cooler evenings, and comfortable pants or jeans. Add one pair of shorts or a skirt for the sunny second day. Day 1 brings rain, so bring a compact rain jacket or small umbrella. Also bring water-resistant shoes or sneakers that can handle wet cobblestones, and a spare pair of socks. For Day 2's sunshine, add sunglasses, sunscreen, and a hat or cap. A reusable water bottle will help while you walk around the city. Round out your bag with:\n- underwear and sleepwear\n- a phone charger\n- toiletries\n- your passport or ID\n- a small daypack or crossbody bag, preferably with zippers because busy areas of Barcelona attract pickpockets\n- a plastic bag to keep damp items separate"
   },
